        <body>
            <div xml:id="d861-a1">

                <pb facs="0833" n="735" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg735"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fusinato to Mr.
                            Iddings.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-07-30"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 30,
                    1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is my painful duty to convey to your knowledge that His Majesty, King Humbert
                    I, the victim of an odious criminal act, died at Monza last night, July 29.</p>
                <p>By virtue of the constitution of the Kingdom, His Royal Highness Prince Victor
                    Emanuel is called to succeed him.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of the occasion, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. Fusinato</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Under Secretary of State.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
